+* Wire unit tests: 7 / 82 assertions on 7.2 and 7 / 78 on 8.1, all passing.
+* Rails 8.1.4 on 8.1 defaults: full suite, 5,322 tests / 23,918 assertions,
+  zero failures/errors.
+* Both suites: 41 skips for optional/unavailable services and tools. Browser
+  system tests and MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQL Server were not executed locally.
+* Both lockfiles resolve on Ruby 3.4.8; changed Ruby files pass RuboCop, and
+  `git diff --check` is clean. No production credentials were used in the probes
+  or production-mode boot checks.
+
+### Earlier release verification
+
+### Historical results: deployed Rails 6.1 bridge
+
+Verified with SQLite and Ruby 3.2.9 before promotion:
+
